  "description": "Provision a repo for the dev-team plugin end to end — install the plugin's own prerequisites (jq, python3, per-language mutation tooling — Stryker, pitest, Stryker.NET), then generate dev-team-specific project configuration — project-level CLAUDE.md, the PostToolUse formatting hook, language-specific agent template activation, and a generated `/pr` command — from the stack signal `/dev-team:project-init` establishes. This is NOT where toolchain detection/installation itself lives (that's `/project-init`); `/setup` only consumes it. Use this when onboarding a new project to the dev-team plugin, when the mutation gate reports a missing tool, or when the user says \"setup\", \"bootstrap\", \"configure this project for dev-team\", \"install required tools for the dev-team plugin\", or \"activate agent templates\".",
